    "body_html": "<div style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/5626/1451/files/h_1024x1024_d74a5863-ba05-4961-93d0-7014699f4dcd.webp?v=1697285906\"></span></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Introducing the Gravity Glider!</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>Experience the <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\">next level of RC flying</span></strong> with the Gravity Glider™, a cutting-edge aircraft designed for <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\">unbeatable durability and excitement</span></strong>. Unlike fragile alternatives, this RC plane is engineered to handle every adventure, making it ideal for enthusiasts of all levels. The Gravity Glider™ is equipped with landing gear and a uniquely designed <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"><strong>gyro stabilization system</strong></span>. This makes take off and flying, stable and controlled with ease, allowing even beginner pilots a steady flight. <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <br></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/5626/1451/files/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-2023-06-17T161516.733_480x480_cbac48aa-1bc2-43e7-8de9-7c9c43b71fce_480x480.webp?v=1697287001\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"> </div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Elevate Your Flying Experience</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br>The silicone head is <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"><strong>wear resistant</strong></span> giving you an exhilarating and <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"><strong>stress free flight</strong></span>. We have designed our Gravity Glider™ with the intention of protecting the electronic components, as well as ensuring that the Gravity Glider™ will float if crashed in water. Discover unmatched control and agility as you pilot the Gravity Glider™ through the skies. Its high-speed motor ensures thrilling flights, while the <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\">l</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\">ong-lasting rechargeable battery</span></strong> extends your playtime. </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/5626/1451/files/s-l1600_5.jpg?v=1697287819\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<strong> </strong>Explore Unmatched Thrills</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Your Gravity Glider™ package comes complete with the RC plane, an intuitive controller, a rechargeable battery, and<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"> easy-to-follow instructions</span></strong>. Assembly is a breeze, allowing you to take off on your aerial adventure within minutes of unboxing. Don't miss this chance to transform your leisure time into unforgettable moments. Order your Gravity Glider now, and experience the <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\">future of RC flying</span></strong> - unbreakable, unbeatable, and utterly exhilarating!</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0549/5626/1451/files/Hand_Toss_1_-1.webp?v=1763716296\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Why Buy From Us?</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; text-decoration: underline;\"><br></span></span></span>\n</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<span style=\"color: #ff5757;\"> <strong>Free Express Shipping &amp; Free 60 Day - Hassle Free Returns. </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Part of The Gravity Glider's 100% satisfaction guarantee.</span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span style=\"color: #ff8000;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\">Highest Quality Materials.</span> </strong></span>We source the finest quality materials for our <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Gravity Gliders</span>. This ensures your <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Gravity Glider</span> will continue working and provide you enjoyment that last for years!</li>\n<li>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"><strong><span>100% Satisfaction Guarantee</span>.</strong></span> You have zero risk trying out The <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Gravity </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Glider</span>. If you are not happy with your order we will send you a free replacement or your money back!</li>\n<li>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 87, 87);\"><span> <strong>The Gravity Glider's are 50% stronger and 1000% more fun than our competition.</strong></span> </span>Our <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Gravity Glider's</span> are made to last with optimal performance in mind. This quality guarantee sets us a level above knockoffs that break within days and use weak batteries.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
